# Date								: 30-01-2013
# Description						: This script checks for head office sol and the zones to perform the operation.
# Input Values						: None
# Output Values						: To pass the values to JSP for home solid and the zones specified.
# Called Scripts					: outward_clearing_custom.jsp
# Calling Script					: getcparamvalue.scr
# Author     						: Manoj
# Bank								: Equity Bank,KENYA
# Modification History				:
#		< Version No.> 		<Date>		<Author Name> 		<Description>
